  "summary_en": "SDAIA's May 2025 National AI Index document sets out a framework and methodology for assessing the AI adoption readiness of Saudi government entities. It uses three pillars (Directions, Enablers, Outputs), seven sub-pillars and 23 domains, maturity levels, periodic measurement and recommendations. It has no robotics or embodied-AI content.",
